## Product Data Conventions

- **Dimensions** are in inches. **Weights** are in ounces.
- **Prices** are USD unless a different currency is passed in buyer context.
- **RFID protection** applies to leather card pockets only, on Vertical Leather Wallets, Leather Bifold Wallets, Vegan Leather Bifold Wallets, and Leather Zip Wallets. Elastic Wallets do not have RFID blocking.
- **Colorways** are style names, not always literal color descriptions. Names like "Wilson," "Ranger," "Gwen," and "Wylde" describe a specific print or colorway rather than a color. Read the variant title and product images rather than inferring color from the name.
- **Attachment hardware varies by product:** Elastic Wallets have an attached keyring. Vertical Leather Wallets have a metal D-ring. Not every product has an attachment point. Do not assume a wallet can clip to a lanyard unless the product data confirms hardware.
- **Sizing:** most products are one size. Bags list capacity by dimensions rather than volume.
- **Care:** fabric products are hand wash, cold, air dry.

