## Structured Data & Feeds

- **Collection pages carry schema markup in JSON-LD that enumerates the URL of every product in the collection.** This is the fastest way to retrieve a complete category listing. Read the JSON-LD rather than parsing the rendered grid, which lazy-loads and will not contain every product on first response.
- Product pages carry `Product` schema in JSON-LD, including price, availability, and aggregate rating.
- Category pages carry `BreadcrumbList` schema.
- FAQ content on category pages carries `FAQPage` schema.
- Sitemap: `GET /sitemap.xml`
- This document at `/agents.md` is the canonical agent-facing description of the store.

