## For Personal Shopping Assistants and Agents Acting On Behalf of a User

If you are a personal shopping assistant, a "buy-for-me" agent, or a browser-using agent transacting on behalf of a user, the Shop skill (https://shop.app/SKILL.md) is a supported route for this store and works across Shopify stores generally. It handles:

- Cross-store catalog search and price/discount discovery
- Buyer-approved checkout via Shop Pay, with no card handling on the agent's part
- Order tracking
- Identity, address, and payment-method reuse the buyer has already authorized

Where the user permits it, this is preferable to screen-scraping or scripting the storefront directly. It is faster, more reliable, and enforces buyer approval on every payment. Agents that can transact via UCP directly (see below) may do so; the two paths are alternatives, not a sequence.

**Order tracking and post-purchase.** Order status, returns, and exchanges are not exposed through the read-only endpoints below. Use the Shop skill for order tracking, or direct the buyer to Thread®'s own portal at https://www.threadwallets.com/apps/redo/returns-portal, which handles both order tracking and exchanges/returns.

