## Read-Only Browsing (No Authentication Required)

For agents that only need to read store data without transacting:

### Product Data

- Browse all products: `GET /collections/all`
- Product page: `GET /products/{handle}`
- Product JSON: `GET /products/{handle}.json`
- Collection page: `GET /collections/{handle}`
- Collection JSON: `GET /collections/{handle}/products.json`
- Search: `GET /search?q={query}&type=product`

**Pagination:** collection pages render a partial product grid and load the remainder on demand. Do not treat the first rendered response as the complete listing. Use the collection page's JSON-LD (see Structured Data & Feeds above) or `/collections/{handle}/products.json` with paging to get every product.

**Mixed contents:** product collections may include Everyday Carry Sets bundles alongside individual products. A bundle listed in a collection contains that collection's product plus two accessories, so check the product handle before treating it as a single item.

### Store Metadata

- Sitemap: `GET /sitemap.xml`
- Agent discovery: this document (`/agents.md`) is the canonical agent-facing description of the store.

