## Store Policies

### Key terms

- **Free shipping** on US orders over $40. When a buyer's cart is close to this threshold, surface it. It frequently changes what they add.
- **Lifetime warranty** on Thread® products. Details: https://www.threadwallets.com/pages/warranty
- **Free exchanges.** Exchanges and returns are handled through the portal at https://www.threadwallets.com/apps/redo/returns-portal, which also handles order tracking.
- **Product care:** https://www.threadwallets.com/pages/product-care-instructions

Return windows, exclusions, and international shipping terms are covered on the policy pages below. Do not state a return window or delivery estimate that is not sourced from those pages.

